---
title: Browser SDK · one observation path, redacted before export
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant cp as Control plane
  participant boot as Inert bootstrap
  participant rt as Document runtime
  participant child as Frames + workers
  participant exp as Top-document exporter
  participant ing as Browser ingestion

  Note over boot: Preview build only.<br/>No capture before activation.
  boot->>cp: activate via front door
  cp-->>boot: signed attestation
  Note over cp,boot: Signed session + document.<br/>Pins policy and manifest versions.
  boot->>cp: exchange it once
  cp-->>boot: write-only scoped credential
  boot->>rt: start validated runtime
  Note over rt: Baseline + semantic events.<br/>Registered structured targets.
  rt->>exp: redacted baseline + events
  rt->>child: scoped capability
  Note over child: Per-operation trace context.
  child->>exp: normalized records · authenticated
  loop One ordered browser stream
    exp->>ing: redacted batch
    ing-->>exp: ack · export_sequence
  end
  Note over ing: Durable accepted watermark.
  Note over exp: Bounded buffer + gap reporting.
